### SITHIYAMA backend - example requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the IntelliJ HTTP client.
### Start the stack first:  docker compose up --build
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Auth
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Register a hiker
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manoj",
  "email": "manoj@example.lk",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "Manoj Perera",
  "phone": "+94771234567",
  "locale": "si"
}

### Sign in as the seeded guide
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "guide",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Route library (public read)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Everything in the Knuckles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/routes?region=Knuckles&size=10

### Free-text search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/routes?q=waterfall

### Radius search 5 km around Riverston (PostGIS ST_DWithin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/routes?nearLat=7.53&nearLon=80.75&radiusMeters=5000

### Long routes only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/routes?minDistanceMeters=8000&difficulty=HARD

### Publish a route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gerandigala Ridge Walk",
  "description": "The route the 2023 group was rescued from. Exposed in rain and fog.",
  "region": "Knuckles",
  "difficulty": "HARD",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "ascentMeters": 640,
  "tags": ["knuckles", "ridge", "exposed"],
  "path": [
    { "latitude": 7.4380, "longitude": 80.7650 },
    { "latitude": 7.4320, "longitude": 80.7720 },
    { "latitude": 7.4260, "longitude": 80.7810 },
    { "latitude": 7.4190, "longitude": 80.7895 }
  ],
  "waypoints": [
    { "name": "Trailhead", "type": "TRAILHEAD", "latitude": 7.4380, "longitude": 80.7650 },
    { "name": "Exposed shoulder", "type": "HAZARD", "latitude": 7.4260, "longitude": 80.7810, "note": "No shelter, single file" },
    { "name": "Summit", "type": "VIEWPOINT", "latitude": 7.4190, "longitude": 80.7895 }
  ]
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Track sync (app recording or Companion Node breadcrumbs)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Node breadcrumb log - Knuckles",
  "source": "NODE",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "startedAt": "2026-01-04T01:30:00Z",
  "points": [
    { "latitude": 7.4640, "longitude": 80.7780, "batteryPercent": 92, "recordedAt": "2026-01-04T01:30:00Z" },
    { "latitude": 7.4588, "longitude": 80.7845, "batteryPercent": 88, "recordedAt": "2026-01-04T01:48:00Z" },
    { "latitude": 7.4505, "longitude": 80.7910, "batteryPercent": 84, "recordedAt": "2026-01-04T02:06:00Z" }
  ]
}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Trip plans and check-ins
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Knuckles day hike - 12 people",
  "plannedStartAt": "2026-01-04T00:30:00Z",
  "plannedEndAt": "2026-01-04T11:00:00Z",
  "groupSize": 12,
  "checkInIntervalMinutes": 90,
  "emergencyContactName": "Nimal Perera",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "+94770000000",
  "members": [
    { "name": "Saman (leader)", "phone": "+94771111111", "teamLead": true },
    { "name": "Kumari", "phone": "+94772222222" }
  ]
}

### Check in (proof of life)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trips/PASTE_TRIP_ID/check-ins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 7.4588,
  "longitude": 80.7845,
  "batteryPercent": 61,
  "message": "Past the cloud forest gate"
}

### Trips that have missed their check-in window
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trips/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### SOS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Raise an alert the way a Companion Node would
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "NODE",
  "latitude": 7.4505,
  "longitude": 80.7910,
  "batteryPercent": 17,
  "message": "Fall detected, no response to check-in",
  "trail": [
    { "latitude": 7.4640, "longitude": 80.7780 },
    { "latitude": 7.4588, "longitude": 80.7845 },
    { "latitude": 7.4505, "longitude": 80.7910 }
  ]
}

### Operations view (ranger or admin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Acknowledge - use the seeded ranger
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos/PASTE_ALERT_ID/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resolve
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos/PASTE_ALERT_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "note": "Group walked out at dawn"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### Companion Nodes
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceCode": "RAK-0001",
  "label": "Group node A",
  "firmwareVersion": "0.1.0"
}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/nodes/PASTE_NODE_ID/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batteryPercent": 88,
  "latitude": 7.4640,
  "longitude": 80.7780,
  "firmwareVersion": "0.2.0"
}
